nese Internet  companies former employees have helped  start more than a hundred and forty-five  new businesses they've attracted people  who believed they could do something  different individuals who are dreamers  and felt that they could change the  Chinese economy through Alibaba this  close-knit culture has been a critical  part of alibaba's identity and keeping  it all when the family has helped the  company grow into a global powerhouse  with over 24,000 employees that's more  than Facebook and Yahoo combined
 

